+| Color combiner | `ColorCombiner` command stream; generated GLSL | Implemented, host-tested source generator; MSL not Apple-compiled | Full key and 1/2-cycle formula, fog, edge discard, light map, world color flags and three-point filter translation |
 | Vertex stream | Clip-space position, UV0/1, optional fog/light map, combiner inputs | Backend source implemented | Dynamic descriptor follows generated metadata; no iOS compiler validation yet |
-| Texture upload/cache | RGBA8 uploads; two tiles; N64 wrap/filter modes | Backend source implemented | Bounded cache and sampler creation; no invalidation/deletion callback exists in current API; DynOS replacement lifetime unverified |
