 | Depth and decal | Backend depth test/write and z-mode decal callbacks | Backend source implemented | LEQUAL/always states and polygon depth bias; no GPU validation |
 | Alpha/transparency | Alpha variant plus blend state and texture-edge discard | Backend source implemented | GL blend factors are represented; no visual test of ordering or blend parity |
